<name>Intelligent Parking Assist System</name>
<para id="RM00000303R000X" category="C" type-id="8039T" name-id="672BV-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<dtccode>C1AEE</dtccode>
<dtcname>IPA Sensor Communication Circuit Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000303R000X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A8N00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The television camera controller communicates with ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FLS sensor) via ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor) and ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor). This DTC is output when the television camera controller's self-diagnosis determines that there is a malfunction in communication with ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FLS sensor), which is connected via ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor) or ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor).</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1AEE</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IPA Ultrasonic Sensor Communication Bus Malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Wire harness and connector between television camera controller and ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire harness and connector between ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor) and ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FLS sensor)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Ultrasonic Sensor NO.1 (FLS Sensor)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Television Camera Controller</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000303R000X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A8O00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E144419J01" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000303R000X_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A8P00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the battery terminal is disconnected, perform steering sensor steering angle neutral point memorization. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001LYW00PX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Depending on the parts replaced or the work performed during inspection, registration settings for other systems may be necessary in addition to the intelligent parking assist system. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000304S000X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000303R000X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000303R000X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A8Q00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the DTCs by following the screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OCQ007X"/>)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" on the screen to clear the data. </ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Start the engine, check the DTCs again, and proceed to the following destination.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>"C1AEE" is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>"C1AEE", "C1631" and "C1AE0" are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>"C1AEE", "C1632" and "C1AE5" are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No DTC Output (Normal)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000303R000X_04_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000303R000X_04_0011" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000303R000X_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A8R00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Television Camera Controller - Ultrasonic Sensor NO.1 (FRS Sensor))</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09843-18040</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the television camera controller shown in the illustration.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141824J08" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor) connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141929J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the wire harness between the television camera controller and ultrasonic sensor NO.1 (FRS sensor).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.45in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A8 (CSB3) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A28 (LIN3) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A27 (CSG3) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A8(CSB3) - 1(BI)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A28(LIN3) - 3(SI)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A27(CSG3) - 5(EI)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000303R000X_04_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000303R000X_04_0012" fin="true">NG</right>
